    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four desperate passengers. One cursed train. No turning back.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Dead Haul</i>, you and up to three others have barely escaped the crumbling city of Brimstone. Your only path forward is a rusted train cutting through forgotten mountain passes and lands left to fester under older, hungrier powers. At each stop, you\u2019ll break into decaying castles, haunted crypts, and once-grand manors, grabbing whatever valuables you can to pay for the next leg of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But time is never on your side. The sun sets fast out here, and when the bells toll twelve, something ancient begins to stir. Miss the final bell and the train leaves without you, doors sealed - your fate sealed with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-Op Horror Heists:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\u20134 players must work together to infiltrate haunted estates, recover valuables and escape before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562400/extras/6e5f802902a2d764b0fda4c261c10f91.poster.avif?t=1753843162\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562400/extras/6e5f802902a2d764b0fda4c261c10f91.webm?t=1753843162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562400/extras/6e5f802902a2d764b0fda4c261c10f91.mp4?t=1753843162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race the Clock:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a gamble. The deeper you explore, the greater the reward, but so is the risk of being trapped inside when the hour strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562400/extras/4a43de7ca56876237fa29136c86acd82.poster.avif?t=1753843162\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562400/extras/4a43de7ca56876237fa29136c86acd82.webm?t=1753843162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562400/extras/4a43de7ca56876237fa29136c86acd82.mp4?t=1753843162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets Beneath the Dust:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location hides more than just treasure. Solve eerie rituals, unlock sealed chambers, and uncover cursed mechanisms to earn greater rewards\u2026 or unleash something worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562400/extras/df538056362f7d8a19a07fa41de58c09.poster.avif?t=1753843162\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562400/extras/df538056362f7d8a19a07fa41de58c09.webm?t=1753843162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562400/extras/df538056362f7d8a19a07fa41de58c09.mp4?t=1753843162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support Roles:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay behind at camp to brew potions, tend to the team, or dispatch the ever-loyal (and oddly fearless) Yipyip to ferry supplies between the train and the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562400/extras/6141d8047a4d0d0836986009243798fc.poster.avif?t=1753843162\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562400/extras/6141d8047a4d0d0836986009243798fc.webm?t=1753843162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562400/extras/6141d8047a4d0d0836986009243798fc.mp4?t=1753843162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trophies of Survival:</strong> Unlock cosmetic gear by completing daring escapes, mastering cursed locales, and surviving the impossible. Show the world what you\u2019ve endured, one bloodstained hat at a time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Conductor:</strong> Your guide, your jailer, your merchant of last resort. He'll keep the train running\u2026 for a price.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four desperate passengers. One cursed train. No turning back.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Dead Haul</i>, you and up to three others have barely escaped the crumbling city of Brimstone. Your only path forward is a rusted train cutting through forgotten mountain passes and lands left to fester under older, hungrier powers. At each stop, you\u2019ll break into decaying castles, haunted crypts, and once-grand manors, grabbing whatever valuables you can to pay for the next leg of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But time is never on your side. The sun sets fast out here, and when the bells toll twelve, something ancient begins to stir. Miss the final bell and the train leaves without you, doors sealed - your fate sealed with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-Op Horror Heists:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\u20134 players must work together to infiltrate haunted estates, recover valuables and escape before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562400/extras/6e5f802902a2d764b0fda4c261c10f91.poster.avif?t=1753843162\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562400/extras/6e5f802902a2d764b0fda4c261c10f91.webm?t=1753843162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562400/extras/6e5f802902a2d764b0fda4c261c10f91.mp4?t=1753843162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race the Clock:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a gamble. The deeper you explore, the greater the reward, but so is the risk of being trapped inside when the hour str