an class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562400/extras/6141d8047a4d0d0836986009243798fc.poster.avif?t=1753843162\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562400/extras/6141d8047a4d0d0836986009243798fc.webm?t=1753843162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562400/extras/6141d8047a4d0d0836986009243798fc.mp4?t=1753843162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trophies of Survival:</strong> Unlock cosmetic gear by completing daring escapes, mastering cursed locales, and surviving the impossible. Show the world what you\u2019ve endured, one bloodstained hat at a time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Conductor:</strong> Your guide, your jailer, your merchant of last resort. He'll keep the train running\u2026 for a price.</p></li></ul>",
